<title>USA: KISTA Elliott Cty SD, Ky., won by Ross, Sinclaire.</title>
<headline>KISTA Elliott Cty SD, Ky., won by Ross, Sinclaire.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ross, Sinclaire &amp; Associates, Inc said it won $3.6 million of Kentucky Interlocal State Transportation Association, Elliott County School District, lease program revenue bonds, 1997 convertible rate series C.</p>
</text>
